OL,3,ANvidia shares soar after Jensen Huang
OL,4,Areturns as CEO following affair with
OL,5,Aalleged spy
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump calls Huang a "great
OL,8,Fpatriot", adding the US government has
OL,9,F"no reason to believe" his return poses
OL,10,Fa national security risk
OL,12,FHuang says: "I take this responsibility
OL,13,Fwith the greatest humility and renewed
OL,14,Fcommitment" - read his full statement
OL,16,FNvidia shares jumped by around 30% as
OL,17,FWall Street opened
